SEQUENCE C: E[c₅] — Average directed 5-cycles
------------------------------------------------------------

  For 5 specific vertices: 12 directed 5-cycles, each prob 1/32.
  E[c₅] = C(n,5) × 12/32 = C(n,5) × 3/8

  n= 2: E[c₅] = 0 = 0.00
  n= 3: E[c₅] = 0 = 0.00
  n= 4: E[c₅] = 0 = 0.00
